about the world and  what is his ultimate goal and of course  the most mysterious of all why doesn't  he sleep and how can he have two devil  fruit powers if you're still keeping  track at home that brings us to 90  mysteries yet to be solved in the series  but we're far from done yet all of these  people and places still don't get into  the core mysteries of one piece what is  the true history of this world we still  need to know what has happened during  the void century what is the true past  of the world governments and what was  the ancient kingdom that they clashed  with what was the great cleansing that  led to the presumed end of this ancient  kingdom in wano we learned a whole lot  about luffy's devil fruit but for every  answer that we received we had more  questions pop up in their place luffy is  definitely the next joy boy or just joy  boy but we still have to wonder who was  joy boy or is joy boy and did the giant  straw hat in marijuana belong to him  originally we do know that luffy's fruit  wasn't actually the gumu gumu no me it  turned out to secretly be the hitohitomi  model nika all along but who or what is  the sun god's nika in this world and  speaking of his very special fruit we  still need a certain dr vegapunk to  explain to us what exactly double fruits  are in the first place we still kind of  don't really know what about luffy's  other special powers that go beyond his  amazing feats of hockey or devil fruit  usage what is the will of d and the  secret behind his and so many other  characters mysterious middle initial  what is the voice of all things and why  can luffy hear it thanks to sukiyaki's  and robin's conversation in the latest  chapter we also just learned that the  ancient weapon pluton is located in wano  paying off a mystery that was introduced  all the way back in alabasta we've  learned quite a bit about shirahoshi aka  poseidon but what are the ancient  weapons what was their purpose we know  that pluton is a battleship of some kind  but who created it and while we're at it  who created the other mysterious massive  boat to noah and for as much as we've  heard about the pluton and poseidon  we've learned absolutely nothing about  uranus what and where is this final  weapon and then of course we're missing  the ultimate mystery the treasure that  luffy has been searching for since  chapter one and the title of the story  what is the one piece before we get into  the most interesting questions though  there are still some other miscellaneous  things that simply need to happen before  the end of the series we still need to  know what the egg was on the oro jackson  we still need to see the open omis  immortality surgery come into play in  some whale form we need to see the grand  fleet reappear during the final war and  there are a few things that aren't super  necessary but we'd really really really  like to see them so get your pen and  paper and start writing those letters to  oda a lot of fans would love to see  another davey bad fight for instance but  with higher stakes we'd also love to see  the thousand sonny's clebautimon make an  appearance as well and while we're now  clearly in the era of god usopp i really  would do a lot to see soggy king just  one last time before the end i mean  people really want to see god valley but  i'm partial to sniper island here  honestly and hey if they made it to  skypia surely the straw hats can make it  into your heart well this brings us to a  whopping 115 mysteries we need solved  and things we need to see in the final  saga of one piece but there is still a  one very important category to go things  that still need to be resolved with the  straw hat crew themselves we've spent 25  years following the adventures of luffy  and his crew each of the straw hats has  a dream and we just know we'll see them  achieve their goals by the end of one  piece puerto rio we still haven't got an  explanation about his missing eye for  instance we also got some massive hints  but no confirmation that he has  relatives in wano hoda went out of his  way to deny that zaro's father was  ushimaru the daimyo of ringo but if not  ushimaru then who and now that he's been  wielding oda's black blade enma we'd  love to see him forge a black blade of  his own oh and what was with his  standoff with the grim reaper of course  now that he's presumably conquered death  he still has an even more formidable foe  to defeat as well before the end we need  to see zorro take on mihawk and become  the greatest swordsman in the world  usopp also has plenty of goals to  accomplish as well he has plenty of lies  that still need to come true we'd love  to see him landing a force of 8 000 men  preferably giants of course become a  true warrior of the sea and reunite with  his father yasuo the chef of the crew  sanji still owes us some answers as well  his explanation for his firepowers is  his burning passion and many have  theorized that it has something to do  with lunarian dna but we still need a  straightforward explanation why the hell  can you conjure fire sanji and for  someone so obsessed with romance will he  ever find love and reunite with viola or  pudding or help nami but more  importantly than his love for women is  his love for cooking so we need to see  him finally find the sea that he's  always dreamed of the all blue we don't  really have too many questions about  nami herself but given that she was  adopted after being found by belmeyer we  could still ask where she's originally  from and who her parents are it doesn't  really matter but given that we've  gotten a lot of extra backstory for  sanji and zoro recently and everyone on  our crew seems to secretly have special  parents for some reason it could very  much still happen what absolutely needs  to happen is that nami needs to achieve  her dream of completing a map of the  entire world with chopper we still have  a few questions about his own fruit  we've speculated that his monster point  is a forced awakening but we could still  use some confirmation from oda here also  given that we've only ever really seen  him as a human reindeer hybrid we have  to ask can chopper go full human form i  mean i don't really want to see it  because it would probably be uncanny and  terrifying but i still do have to ask by  the end of the series though our  favorite doctor still needs to cure the  world's diseases maybe he won't get  every single one but a great one for him  to cure for instance would be the  laughing side effect of the smile fruits  allowing him to further restore the  country of wano with robin most of her  big mysteries we've already covered in  the section about the true history since  that's basically her dream to uncover  the true history however there's still a  very pressing questions where is her  cowgirl hat we can only pray that her  signature hat makes the return in the  final saga in order for us to uncover  all that true history she also needs to  find the remainder of the pony glyphs  and decipher them all given that we just  now basically found out what the very  first poneglyph we saw in alabaster set  it would be really nice if oda could  give us some translation of the other  pony glyphs as well frankie isn't too  mysterious of a figure he kind of lets  it all hang out sometimes a little bit  too literally i feel but before the end  of the series we're sure to see him sail  his dreamship the thousand sunny around  the globe brooke our favorite skeletal  musician obviously has to reunite with  laboon but we'd also like to see how the  number one bob being sake fits in with  the entire story as has been highly  speculated especially in regards to love  tale and the one piece we don't really  have too many questions about jinbe  either but we do want to see him achieve  his goal of brokering peace between  fishermen and humans as well as seeing  the fishman return to the surface we  also don't have too many questions for  yamato except who her mother is but we  do have a lot of questions about our  captain monkey d luffy such as who is  his mother and is it crocodile and while  we're at it who is his grandma because  we don't know who dragon's mom slash  garb's wife partner was either we also  need to see him reunite with his mentor  shanks as well as return his signature  straw hats in a moment that's sure to  leave the fans around the world in tears  we also still need to get confirmation  on what the mysterious dream that he  shares with rogers and last but  certainly not least we need to see luffy  become the king of the pirates oh and  actually for luffy's mom well there is  this extremely well theory out there  that you really shouldn't miss
 

